🔐 3. SECURITY LAYERS

Hash Chain (SHA-256)

```
Identity Hash = SHA256(
  full_name | dob | reference | serial | handle | origin
)

Record Hash = SHA256(JSON.stringify(identity))

Chain Anchor = SHA256(
  identity_hash : record_hash : signature
)
```

